# <prefix>(<scope>): <subject>
# 
# Prefixes: feat, fix, chore
# Scope: optional, lowercase (e.g., factory, skills, docs)
# Subject: max 72 chars, imperative mood ("add" not "adds")
#
# Body: explain what and why (optional)
#
# Footer: Refs #<issue> for factory work
#         BREAKING CHANGE: <description> if breaking
#
# Example:
# feat(factory): add task validation
#
# Refactored the task validation logic to use the new
# schema format. This fixes the validation errors seen
# in PR #123.
#
# Refs #456